# Normalise line endings for text we edit
*.md        text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.ino       text eol=lf
*.h         text eol=lf
*.cpp       text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.manifest  text eol=lf

# CAD and renders are binary. Marking them stops git trying to diff or merge
# them, and stops line ending translation corrupting them.
#
# Git LFS is deliberately not used. The whole cad/ directory is about 2 MB and
# the largest single file is the 534 KB Fusion archive, which is well inside
# what plain git handles comfortably. LFS would add a dependency and burn
# quota for no benefit at this size. If the design grows past tens of
# megabytes, revisit it.
*.f3d   binary
*.f3z   binary
*.step  binary
*.stp   binary
*.stl   binary
*.dxf   binary
*.png   binary
